{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55633","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有山有水更何忧，知足能令万事休。\n大道不从心外得，浮荣须向世间求。\n冲开烟缕飞黄鸟，点破潭心漾白鸥。\n好景尽归余掌握，岂劳艰险访瀛洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}